<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
<td width="*"><div style="margin: 5px"><font color="#c0c0c0" size="2" face="verdana">

Following spells available at vendor in Shadow Haven at 1375 -550:<p>

Okiel's Embers Level 12 6pp 4gp 5sp 2cp at Apprehensive<br>
Garrison's Mighty Mana Shock Level 20 32pp 2gp 5sp 8cp<br>
Minor Familiar Level 29 48pp 3gp 8sp 7cp<br>
Elnerick's Entombment of Ice Level 39 6pp 4gp 5sp 2cp<br>
Lesser Familiar Level 49 8pp 6cp 5cp<p>

Katta Castellum has guilds for wizards, enchanters, and mages. its sorta hard to find,<br> but its there. Also, had firetree's familiar augment(lvl52)<br> and Familiar(lvl54) drop off mobs in Fungal Grove, <br>mobs conned green to blue to me at lvl 54. <br>Still working on the port spells =/<p>

Spells<br>
O'Keils Embers Single Target Fire Resistance and Damage Shield 35mana lvl12<br>
---Bought in:Shadow Haven at 1375, -550 for ~6pp<p>

Garrisons Mighty Mana Shock Single Target Magic Based Direct Damage 90mana lvl20<br>
---Bought in:Shadow Haven at 1375, -550 for ~32pp<p>

Nexus Gate Self Only Gate to the Nexus on the Moon of Luclin 150mana lvl20<p>

Nexus Portal Group Gate to the Nexus on the Moon of Luclin 300mana lvl29<p>

Summon Minor Familiar Summon a Familiar 290mana lvl29<br>
---Bought in:Shadow Haven at 1375, -550 for ~48pp<br>
---Effect:No mana regen, +10 to all resists<p>

Elnerick's Entombment of Ice Single Target Root and Cold Based Direct Damage (Max: 345) 225mana lvl39<br>
---Bought in:Shadow Haven at 1375, -550 for ~6pp<p>

Translocate: Nexus Single Target Teleport to the Nexus on the Moon of Luclin 225mana lvl39<p>

Summon Lesser Familiar Summon a Familiar 490mana lvl49<br>
---Bought in:Shadow Haven at 1375, -550 for ~8pp<br>
---Effect: 1 mana/tic, +15 to all resists<p>

Levitation Single Target Levitation Buff 60mana lvl51<p>

Firetree's Familiar Augment Wizard Familiar HP & Movement Speed Buff 250mana lvl52<br>
---Found In: Fungus Grove<br>
---Found On: Shik-nar, Tarmoks<p>

Summon Familiar Summon a Familiar 525mana lvl54<br>
---Found In: Fungal Grove<br>
---Found On: Tarmoks<br>
---Looks like a Drake<br>
---Effect: 2 mana/tic, +20 to all resists<p>

